## Files

{% set archive_name = record.archive.href.split("/")[-1] %}
- [`{{ stats.href }}`]({{ public("v" ~ version ~ "/" ~ data_rel) }}): {{ "{:,}".format(stats.row_count) }} rows, {{ "%.1f" | format(record.files[data_rel].size / 1e6) }} MB. GeoParquet {{ stats.geoparquet_version }} in {{ stats.row_groups }} row groups of up to {{ "{:,}".format(stats.row_group_size) }} rows, zstd-compressed and ordered along a Hilbert curve. A `bbox` column lets readers skip row groups in a spatial filter.
- [`{{ archive_name }}`]({{ public("v" ~ version ~ "/" ~ record.archive.href) }}): the web map archive (PMTiles, vector tiles, z{{ record.archive.minzoom }} to z{{ record.archive.maxzoom }}), with the layers `{{ spec.pmtiles_layers | join("`, `") }}`. The tiles carry every column except the list and struct columns, which vector tiles cannot store: `{{ untiled | join("`, `") }}`. Fetch those from the GeoParquet file by `rgi_id`. Timestamps are strings in the tiles.

