## Access

No account and no download are needed. This DuckDB query reads one glacier:

```sql
INSTALL httpfs; LOAD httpfs;
SELECT rgi_id, display_name, area_km2, zmed_m
FROM '{{ public("v" ~ version ~ "/" ~ data_rel) }}'
WHERE rgi_id = 'RGI2000-v7.0-G-11-01706';
```

`{{ name }}/AGENTS.md` has more recipes. Each file is also readable over
anonymous S3 at `{{ meta.public_s3_base }}/v{{ version }}/{{ data_rel }}`.

